Wh-what?!

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:22.830
Japan's

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:21.160
I like to watch anime while enjoying snacks

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:21.160
and drinking Sbrite!

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.750
She's just like me!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.830
So, Sylphin has been having "feasts" of her own.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.120
Actually, I'm pretty particular

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.120
