Puura puraa, puura puraa, puura puraa puuraa

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:11.580
Shake, shake, shake-shake-shake, shake

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:12.120
Left!

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:12.120
Puura puraa, puura puraa, puura puraa puuraa

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:12.120
Shake, shake, shake-shake-shake, shake

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:15.120
Puura puraa, puura puraa, puura puraa de yatte ikou!

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:15.120
Shake, shake, shake-shake-shake, and let's go!

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:29.080
Sore ja, mazu wa kou shite, hamster no pose

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:29.080
Well, let's start of with this, the Hamster Pose

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:31.870
Hamu! Hamu! Ah, hamu hamu hamu hamu!

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:31.870
Ham! Ham! Ah, ham, ham, ham-ham!

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.750
Tsugi wa kime-pose. Saa, ikimasu wa yo?

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.750
Next up, my signature pose. Here I go, indeed!

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:37.790
Shbafeen! Shbafeen! Shba-shbafeen!

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:42.410
Higoro no kinchou o hogusu you ni

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:42.410
To get rid of the stress of everyday life

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:45.120
Hyoujou, yurumete

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:45.120
Turn that frown upside-down

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:48.870
Zenshin, chikara o nuite

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:48.870
Let your whole body relax

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.700
Daradaradaradaradaradaradaradara...

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.700
Just lounge and lounge and lounge and lounge...

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:53.120
Daradarakara no...

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:53.120
And from the lounging comes...

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:53.790
Umaruuun!

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:59.620
See no! Ne! Ne! Ne! Shiawase no hiketsu, sore wa egao desho?

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:59.620
Here goes! Hey! Hey! Hey! Smiling is the key to happiness, right?

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:00.250
(Yay!)

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:00.250
